      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ad5be37f1f16726",
      "translationZh": "38 t/s 在 182k 上下文；~61 t/s 短上下文",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "692b67d6d1a02e2c",
      "translationZh": "投机（MTP）接受",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d43eba173f81a4eb",
      "translationZh": "无错误，在 OpenCode 中运行",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "473933ce8edf07fd",
      "translationZh": "使用的量化：Unsloth UD-Q3_K_XL（动态量化）。这不是 Strata 默认推荐的量化。那个量化更快但产生了轻微错误且（主观上）质量较低；我们选择了 Unsloth 的量化，以准确性优先于速度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "15dfd900019a5dc5",
      "translationZh": "所需的适配（量化 + Strata）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47b644b396f5330b",
      "translationZh": "使用 --compat-bf16 打包（Strata 将一些张量读取为 BF16）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "815c8e3e4b3db526",
      "translationZh": "在 Strata（重新编译 / 重新配置）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1024995729542e29",
      "translationZh": "为 sm_86 重新构建，启用 MMQ（ -DSTRATA_MMQ_KQUANTS=ON ）。这使得 Q4 类提示速度翻倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fbf14b62825ccca",
      "translationZh": "在配置中禁用了 STRATA_PF_FUSED=0。融合内核在量化专家的 \"down\" 类型不受支持时会崩溃（非法内存访问）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11785ead752d3945",
      "translationZh": "视觉编码器移至 GPU：使用 CUDA 重新编译 strata-vision（之前仅 CPU），并在所有配置中设置 vision.gpu=true 以及 --vram-reserve-mib 700。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a4b8535f0f23849",
      "translationZh": "按模型校准（ --pcie-frac 、 --pool-workers 、 --spec-min-p ）以及 --expert-profile-save 以学习并持久化专家缓存。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67e9a134ab498d72",
      "translationZh": "调整的配置（此模型）：上下文 256k ，--kv fp16 ，--kv-resident 32768 ，专家缓存自动（6,517 个槽位 / ~14 GB），--spec 4 ，--pcie-frac 0.00 ，--pool-workers 9 ，--spec-min-p 0.70 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
